356
00:32:39.791 --> 00:32:41.834
<i>Pinatay ko ang aking asawa. Oo.</i>

357
00:32:41.918 --> 00:32:44.337
<i>Pero hindi ako ang pumatay kay Ko Se-hun.</i>

358
00:32:44.837 --> 00:32:47.840
<i>Handa akong tanggapin ang parusa</i>
<i>para sa krimen na ginawa ko,</i>

359
00:32:47.924 --> 00:32:49.968
<i>ngunit may kaparusahan din</i>

360
00:32:50.551 --> 00:32:52.095
<i>para sa mamamatay-tao sa batang lalaki.</i>

361
00:32:53.137 --> 00:32:54.555
<i>Isang Yun-su,</i>

362
00:32:56.182 --> 00:32:58.685
<i>ito ba ang sinusubukan mo</i>
<i>upang makipag-usap?</i>

363
00:33:01.646 --> 00:33:04.148
Criminal Investigation Team Two, oo?

364
00:33:04.232 --> 00:33:05.566
Oo. Salamat sa pag-abot.

365
00:33:09.028 --> 00:33:11.406
- Gyeonggi Bukbu Police Station, oo?
- Bilisan mo.

366
00:33:12.573 --> 00:33:14.867
Hindi kami makasagot
mga tanong na yan ngayon.

367
00:33:14.951 --> 00:33:17.578
Ms. An, ano ang sinusubukan mong gawin?

368
00:33:22.917 --> 00:33:25.920
JUNGDONG GENERAL HOSPITAL

369
00:33:36.639 --> 00:33:37.765
Kaya desperado para sa paghihiganti

370
00:33:37.849 --> 00:33:40.143
na gagawin mo
ibang tao ang gagawa nito para sa iyo.

371
00:33:41.728 --> 00:33:42.603
Ngunit din,

372
00:33:43.730 --> 00:33:46.149
ginawa mo ang lahat ng iyong makakaya
para iligtas ang babaeng iyon.

373
00:33:56.034 --> 00:33:57.493
GU ***-YEONG / F

374
00:33:58.161 --> 00:33:59.120
Pumasok ka.

375
00:34:07.295 --> 00:34:09.255
Gusto ka niyang pasalamatan
para sa pagliligtas sa kanyang buhay.

376
00:34:16.721 --> 00:34:17.930
Manonood ako, okay?

377
00:34:35.948 --> 00:34:37.283
salamat…

378
00:34:39.452 --> 00:34:40.745
para sa pagliligtas ng aking buhay.

379
00:34:42.705 --> 00:34:43.748
Kami ay…

380
00:34:45.458 --> 00:34:46.292
nakilala.

381
00:34:49.087 --> 00:34:50.296
Ito ay isang video call.

382
00:34:51.172 --> 00:34:52.298
tiyak.

383
00:34:52.840 --> 00:34:53.758
alam ko na.

384
00:34:55.134 --> 00:34:56.511
Ang kapatid mo

385
00:34:57.637 --> 00:34:58.846
marami kang pinag-usapan.

386
00:35:00.264 --> 00:35:01.182
naging close kayo?

387
00:35:02.892 --> 00:35:04.268
Hindi sa simula.

388
00:35:05.853 --> 00:35:08.189
Nag skip ako ng school and stuff.
Hindi ako magaling na estudyante.

389
00:35:09.774 --> 00:35:11.025
Ngunit pagkatapos,

390
00:35:11.609 --> 00:35:12.902
siya ay palakaibigan.

391
00:35:13.402 --> 00:35:15.780
Noong naging deskmate tayo,
una niya akong kinausap.

392
00:35:16.280 --> 00:35:17.740
Ganun kami naging close.

393
00:35:19.575 --> 00:35:21.702
Maraming gustong sabihin ang baby sister ko.

394
00:35:27.875 --> 00:35:29.669
Palagi niya akong gustong kausapin.

395
00:35:31.796 --> 00:35:34.423
Ngunit kapag ito ang pinakamahalaga,
Hindi ko siya matulungan, kaya...

396
00:35:51.274 --> 00:35:53.359
- Nandiyan siya.
- Kunin ang mga shot.

397
00:36:00.992 --> 00:36:02.660
Mamaya na! Mamaya na! Okay!

398
00:36:10.626 --> 00:36:13.212
Oh. Hoy, Mr. Baek.

399
00:36:13.296 --> 00:36:15.882
Hindi mo naman talaga tinakpan 'yon diba?

400
00:36:16.382 --> 00:36:17.300
Huh?

401
00:36:18.759 --> 00:36:20.094
Hindi namin ginawa.

402
00:36:20.178 --> 00:36:21.387
Hindi talaga kami!

403
00:36:23.556 --> 00:36:24.849
Hapon, sir.

404
00:36:25.433 --> 00:36:27.685
